{
 "dur": 115.96,
 "lines": [
  {
   "t0": 3.4,
   "t1": 8.92,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Someone is playing in the next room, and the door is shut. Clara presses her ear to it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 8.92,
   "t1": 12.94,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    8.92,
    9.54,
    10.16,
    10.78,
    11.4
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.94,
   "t1": 19.63,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "High or low? The same tune as before, or a new one? Here she cannot see the keys. She can only listen."
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.63,
   "t1": 23.62,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "Shall we listen with her? Is this note high, or low?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 23.62,
   "t1": 25.16,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    23.62
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 25.16,
   "t1": 27.36,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.36,
   "t1": 28.7,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "High."
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.7,
   "t1": 30.46,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "And this one?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 30.46,
   "t1": 32.0,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    30.46
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.0,
   "t1": 34.2,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.2,
   "t1": 35.52,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Low."
  },
  {
   "t0": 35.52,
   "t1": 39.29,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "Now two little tunes. The same, or different?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 39.29,
   "t1": 41.45,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    39.29,
    39.91,
    40.53
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.45,
   "t1": 42.25,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 42.25,
   "t1": 44.41,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    42.25,
    42.87,
    43.49
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.41,
   "t1": 46.61,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 46.61,
   "t1": 49.02,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "The same tune, twice."
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.02,
   "t1": 56.33,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "Now, at the piano. Close your eyes. Ask someone to play two notes. Was the second one higher or lower?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.33,
   "t1": 62.33,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 62.33,
   "t1": 64.85,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "And here is how it ended."
  },
  {
   "t0": 64.85,
   "t1": 72.52,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "When the playing stops, Clara opens the door. There sits the Butler at the old practice piano, one finger still on a key."
  },
  {
   "t0": 72.52,
   "t1": 74.39,
   "who": "P",
   "text": "High, then low"
  },
  {
   "t0": 74.39,
   "t1": 76.27,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "says Clara."
  },
  {
   "t0": 76.27,
   "t1": 78.82,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "And the same tune twice."
  },
  {
   "t0": 78.82,
   "t1": 86.16,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "The Butler writes one word in his book: Correct. Good pianists listen first. The ear tells the fingers where to go."
  },
  {
   "t0": 86.16,
   "t1": 94.79,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "One more thing to try. Face the wall. Ask someone to play a high note or a low one. Say which, then turn round and check."
  },
  {
   "t0": 94.79,
   "t1": 100.79,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 100.79,
   "t1": 101.39,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 101.39,
   "t1": 103.63,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Behind the next door."
  },
  {
   "t0": 103.63,
   "t1": 113.8,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "At the top of the stairs Clara found a door she had never noticed. On it, in gold letters: PRELIM. Inside, someone was practising the same bar, again and again."
  },
  {
   "t0": 113.8,
   "t1": 115.96,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    113.8,
    114.42
   ]
  }
 ]
}